questionDescription:
The scenario must fit the assigned business function. Business function is a separate axis from competency (see Prompt - Competency); the two need not be the obvious pairing.
//
SEE THE SPEC FOR UNIVERSE REFERENCES - IT'S IMPORTANT THAT YOU USE THE CORRECT UNIVERSE FOR YOUR TASK

answerOptionText:
[Fail - Process Rubric Not Needed] 
Two or more process criteria fail one of the three conditions:

(1) Required by every valid path;

(2) Outcome rubric can't cover it; 

(3) Describes a verification, not an execution trace
